"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCauchySequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCauchySequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (本文件定义的集合编码谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCauchySequence}_S(s,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,X)\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\n((N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n)\\to d(s(m),s(n))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCauchySequence}_S(s,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,X)\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\n((N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n)\\to d(s(m),s(n))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>度量空间条件、序列的函数类型以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 条件均显式进入定义，避免仅靠上下文假设约束自由符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":